'''Antenna of the Heart''' (Japanese: '''心のアンテナ''' ''Kokoro no Antenna'') is the Japanese ending theme for ''[[M12|Arceus: To a Conquering Spacetime]]''. It is sung by [[Pokémon Sunday]] host, [[Shōko Nakagawa]].

The version of the song featured in the movie was a more mellow remix arranged by Haruomi Hosono, titled '''Antenna of the Heart -Haruomi Hosono Original Mix-'''.

